        "original_id": "889f8e36-79e3-5020-9fb9-ab81d93b7ee8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Hidden City Entertainment, Hidden City Games, Inc.\n- People: Jesper Myrfors, Paul Peterson\n- Products: Clout Fantasy, Bella Sara\n- Places: Seattle, Sweden\n\nFacts:\n- Jesper Myrfors was born in 1964 in Sweden.\n- Hidden City Games, Inc. was founded in 2004 by Jesper Myrfors and Paul Peterson.\n- Hidden City Games, Inc. was founded to develop and market the chip-throwing game Clout Fantasy.\n- Jesper Myrfors was a founding member of Hidden City Games and Clout Fantasy.\n- Hidden City Entertainment was the later name of Hidden City Games, Inc.\n- Hidden City Entertainment was a Seattle-based game company.\n- Hidden City Entertainment published Bella Sara.\n- Bella Sara began as a trading card game and later expanded into an international product line.",
